        "8_19": "Q(sqrt2) -- shapes 1+sqrt2, -1+sqrt2, -1",
        "note": "these ARE fields generated by shapes, but they are NOT shape fields in the Neumann-Reid sense: that notion is the invariant trace field of a HYPERBOLIC structure, and these manifolds have none. The probe reports no field for them because it gates on positive orientation and stops before identification -- not because no field exists"
